Hello.
Developer: Trifovy (trif, trifov)
This tool was created to simplify the process of finding information about a person based on their nickname.
It currently checks 38 sites, but I plan to add at least 90 more in the future. The tool will soon be fully optimized.
I will implement multithreading to allow for rapid, simultaneous checks across all sites.
A mechanism to bypass bot detection will also be included. Libraries used: colorama, requests.
Dependency installation command: `pip install requests colorama`. Launch command: `python source code.py`.

See you ^_^